{
  "x-fc-pending": {
    "title": "Pending of the spec: what the sandbox adds",
    "description": "What the sandbox imitates and neither the portal's snapshot (spec/funnelchat.json, of 15-10) nor the pending layer of the Node SDK (spec/pending.json) carry yet. Almost all of it is in production since 21-10; it is missing from the snapshot. scripts/generate.mjs applies it after spec/pending.json and only while the snapshot lacks it: when a new snapshot carries it, it says which entries can be deleted.",
    "rules": {
      "paths": "Una operación (método + ruta) se agrega solo si la instantánea no la tiene.",
      "responsePatches": "Un parche reemplaza respuestas de una operación de la instantánea solo mientras esa operación cumple la condición de `while`.",
      "webhookPatches": "Un parche fija propiedades de `data` de un evento (esquema y ejemplo) mientras el evento cumple `while`, o mientras su `data` no trae `whileMissing`.",
      "components.schemas": "Los esquemas de esta capa empiezan con `PendingSandbox` para no chocar con los de la instantánea ni con los de spec/pending.json.",
      "operationPatches": "Un parche suma propiedades al cuerpo de una operación de la instantánea mientras esa operación cumple `while` (si lo tiene)."
    },
    "sources": {
      "conversations-send-queued": "conversations v1.18.10 (a580a3d00, en producción): `ApiKeySendResponse`, `PublicMessageResource`, `ShowMessageController` y `AcceptedSendFailure`. Con clave, el envío responde 200 al instante con el mensaje en cola, `{message: {id, contact_id, device_id, direction, type, status: \"queued\", error, client_reference, created_at, updated_at}}`; la consulta por id GET /api/v1/contacts/{contact}/messages/{message}; y `error` con la clave `reason`.",
      "conversations-received-device": "conversations v1.18.10 (en producción): `device_id` en `data` de message.received (`MessageReceivedPayload`).",
      "conversations-file-by-url": "conversations v1.18.10 (en producción): `SendFileType` — `file` por URL (firmada o sin extensión) con `file_type` y `file_name` opcionales, en POST contacts/{contact}/message y POST message/send-message.",
      "conversations-forms": "conversations v1.18.10 (en producción): `routes/api/whatsapp-forms.php`, `WhatsappFormController`, `WhatsappFormSendController`, `SendWhatsappFormRequest`. Las rutas de formularios abiertas a claves (`config/platform-gate.php`) y el envío de un formulario a un contacto. El portal no las documenta todavía: su `config/borde.json` no tiene el prefijo `forms`."
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "PendingSandboxMessageError": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Why a message failed. `code` and `title` are the provider's (for example Meta); `reason` only comes when Funnelchat stopped it after accepting it, and then `title` is a plain text.",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "title": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "reason": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "enum": [
              "device_unavailable",
              "insufficient_balance",
              "window_closed",
              "recipient_unreachable",
              "template_not_found",
              "template_unresolved_placeholder",
              "not_queued",
              "not_sent",
              null
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "code",
          "title",
          "reason"
        ]
      },
      "PendingSandboxMessage": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "The public object of a message: the same ten keys in the send's answer and in the lookup by id.",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The same id of the history and of `message.status_changed`."
          },
          "contact_id": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "device_id": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "direction": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "inbound",
              "outbound"
            ]
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`text`, `image`, `document`, `template`, `contact`, `note`…"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "enum": [
              "queued",
              "sent",
              "delivered",
              "read",
              "failed",
              null
            ],
            "description": "`queued` when accepted: queued is not sent. Then the vocabulary of `message.status_changed`, or `null` if it is not known whether it went out."
          },
          "error": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PendingSandboxMessageError"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Only when `status` is `failed`."
          },
          "client_reference": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "contact_id",
          "device_id",
          "direction",
          "type",
          "status",
          "error",
          "client_reference",
          "created_at",
          "updated_at"
        ]
      },
      "PendingSandboxSendResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Answer of a send accepted with a key: the queued message.",
        "properties": {
          "message": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PendingSandboxMessage"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "message"
        ]
      },
      "PendingSandboxContactCardResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "One queued message per card, in the order of `contact_card_ids`.",
        "properties": {
          "messages": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PendingSandboxMessage"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "messages"
        ]
      },
      "PendingSandboxForwardResult": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "One destination of the forward, with the message registered for it (or `null` if it was blocked).",
        "properties": {
          "contact_id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "mode": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "reason": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "message": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PendingSandboxMessage"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "contact_id",
          "mode",
          "status",
          "reason",
          "message"
        ]
      },
      "PendingSandboxNotFound": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "The 404 of conversations: only `message`, \"Objeto no encontrado.\".",
        "properties": {
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "message"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/contacts/{contact}/messages/{message}": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "pendingSandboxMessage.show",
        "summary": "Show a message by its id",
        "description": "The current status of a message: `queued` while a send with a key waits its turn; then `sent`, `delivered`, `read` or `failed`, or `null` if it is not known whether it went out. Queued is not sent: the final status arrives by `message.status_changed` or by this lookup.\n\n**Pending of the spec**: it is in production (conversations v1.18.10), missing from the portal's snapshot.",
        "tags": [
          "Message"
        ],
        "x-fc-domain": "conversations",
        "x-fc-permission": "conversations:read",
        "x-fc-pending": "conversations-send-queued",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "contact",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "message",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PendingSandboxMessage"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "The contact or the message does not exist in the account",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PendingSandboxNotFound"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
