      "post": {
        "operationId": "pendingSandboxForms.store",
        "summary": "Create a form",
        "description": "Creates a draft from a template, on an official number (`device_id`) and, optionally, on others (`device_ids`). Answers `201` with `data`, `lint` and `numbers`.\n\n**Pending of the spec**: it is in production, missing from the portal's snapshot.",
